masm is a compilter that compiles .asm files into object files
sample:
./masm < something.asm > something.obj

Mic1 is a cpu emulator (much like an IDE) that will take your object file and given prom.dat file
and output data to stdout being the terminal by default.
sample:
./mic1 prom.dat something.obj 0 2048

